><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Stergais</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Thompson</surname><given-names>Jack</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Northwest's hot topics in preparedness forum: A novel distance-learning collaborative</article-title><source>J Public Health Manag Pract</source><year>2005</year><month>11</month><fpage>S25</fpage><lpage>S32</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="medline">12595404</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16205539</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>DiMaria-Ghalili</surname><given-names>Rose Ann</given-names></name><name><surname>Ostrow</surname><given-names>Lynne</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodney</surname><given-names>Kim</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Webcasting: a new instructional technology in distance graduate nursing education</article-title><source>J Nurs Educ</source><year>2005</year><month>1</month><volume>44</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>11</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="medline">15673169</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15673169</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ostrow</surname><given-names>Lynne</given-names></name><name><surname>DiMaria-Ghalili</surname><given-names>Rose Ann</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Distance education for graduate nursing: one state school's experience</article-title><source>J Nurs Educ</source><year>2005</year><month>1</month><volume>44</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>5</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="medline">15673168</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15673168</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="ref14"><label>14</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author